{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act53side_level_act53side_08_end","storyGroup":"act53side","storySort":16,"storyDependence":"act53side_level_act53side_08_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TO-8","storyName":"以决心做邮戳","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"面对着公司的阻挠，和为了朋友们违背公司意愿冒着危险维修通讯塔的阿梅利亚，安洁莉娜爆发了自己的源石技艺——之前她错过了一次帮助她在乎的人的机会，但这次她会拼尽全力。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act53side/level_act53side_08_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act53side_08","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":14,"next":16,"characters":["塔妮","嘉辛塔","阿梅利亚","安洁莉娜","？？？","安洁莉娜&嘉辛塔","嘉辛塔&塔妮","优雅的夫人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.11","fadetime":"0.1","id":5},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.1","fillto":"0.11","fadetime":"0.1","id":6},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_driveincar","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":7},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":8},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"0.5","ystrength":"0.5","vibrato":"30","randomness":"30","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":9},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_bg_76_g15_dttsuburb_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","x":"-15","id":10},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":12},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$relax_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_relax_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":13,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,-30","id":14},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$1","duration":"1","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,-30","id":15},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"天都亮了，不知道安洁有没有说服阿梅……","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"哼，要是我们之中最讲道理的安洁都拿阿梅没办法，你跟我就一人拽她的一只袖管，把整个人拖上我们的越野车！","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$1","focus":"r","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我喜欢这个点子！","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":24},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carhorn","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"谁啊？比我们还着急？","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"all","id":30},{"type":"backgroundtween","xTo":"10","block":"false","duration":"1","id":31},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":32},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carpassby","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"看车尾的标识好像是纵贯红土公司的，他们要去的方向是……通讯塔？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"等等，你看通讯塔上层是不是有人？","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"阿梅？！","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"没错，那个毛茸茸的大尾巴……是阿梅！","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#14$1","focus":"r","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"她为什么会在这个时间去修塔？难道……","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"没有什么难道！我才不管她为什么要修，但既然她在上面，纵贯红土公司的人又在往那里赶，就说明阿梅不是他们派过去的！","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"那……前面那些赶去通讯塔的人，是找阿梅麻烦的？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"找阿梅麻烦？","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","id":51},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_speedline","layer":"1","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"all","id":53},{"type":"bg","duration":"1","from":"0","to":"1","id":54},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"2","ystrength":"2","vibrato":"50","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":55},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carspeedup","volume":"1","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":57},{"type":"bgeffect","id":58},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"1","ystrength":"1","vibrato":"50","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#20$1","focus":"r","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"嘉嘉嘉嘉辛塔——！","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"你才刚开多长时间的车就敢这么踩油门？！","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"放心吧塔妮，你都不知道我在梦里演练这个场景已经多少次了！","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#19$1","focus":"r","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"梦里——梦里像话吗？！","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":67},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":68},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_speedline","layer":"1","id":69},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carspeedup","volume":"1","id":70},{"type":"backgroundtween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1.1","yScaleTo":"1.1","duration":"3","block":"false","id":71},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"1","ystrength":"1","vibrato":"50","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":72},{"type":"text","text":"橙色越野车不断加速，很快就跟到了安保车队后面。","id":73},{"type":"text","text":"车队最后的那辆货车上的安保人员百无聊赖地打着哈欠，随后看到了窗外两张年轻明媚的笑脸。","id":74},{"type":"dialog","id":75},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_electricbicycle_speedup","volume":"1","id":76},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1","id":77},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1.5","xstrength":"3","ystrength":"3","vibrato":"50","randomness":"50","fadeout":"false","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"-1","xstrength":"1","ystrength":"1","vibrato":"50","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":79},{"type":"text","text":"他还没回过神来，眼前忽然出现一辆橙色的越野车横在自己面前，还顺便喷了他一头的尾气。","id":80},{"type":"text","text":"第二辆、第三辆、第四辆……橙色越野车像不祥的煞星，逼停了安保车队的所有用车。","id":81},{"type":"text","text":"司机们最后记得的是一辆发出畅快笑声的橙色越野车，慢慢消失在他们叫苦连天的抱怨声里。","id":82},{"type":"dialog","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,-30","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$1","duration":"0.5","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,-30","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"嘉辛塔……你可能有赛车的天赋……","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"我也觉得！等去完南境我就要去专业的赛车场跑两圈试试！","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"但现在，我们赶紧去通讯塔！","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":93},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"charslot","id":97},{"type":"bgeffect","id":98},{"type":"curtain","id":99},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0","xstrength":"1","ystrength":"1","vibrato":"50","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":100},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"0","to":"0","id":101},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":102},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_bg_76_g10_dtttowertop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":103},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":104},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":105},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$friend_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act11d0d0/m_sys_friend_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":106,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":107},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"安洁把阿什顿部长他们拖住了？","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#7$1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我骗了她，她……她却还在帮我……呜……","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#10$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"呼……好了，阿梅，现在不是哭的时候。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"通讯核心已经换好了，全自动模块的工作看起来问题也不大……","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":117},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_warning","loop":"true","channel":"b","id":118},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":119},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"b","fadetime":"0.2","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#5$1","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"报错？！我把参数调错了？不可能啊？","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#13$1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"等等……这是最大的一座塔，断连烧毁的电路可能比我想象的更多……","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":126},{"type":"text","text":"她望向通讯塔尖，一块黑灰色的面板证实了她的猜想。","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"还好，只要把感应器重新连接上，通讯塔就能运作了。","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"但从这里到通讯塔尖……好像只有无保护的维修梯能用了……","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#2$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"呜……别发抖啊阿梅，你可以的，你必须可以的！","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":133},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":134},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":135},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"false","block":"false","id":136},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_climbmetalladder","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":137},{"type":"delay","time":"0.6","id":138},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"0.2","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":140},{"type":"text","text":"小小的阿纳缇把工具调整到称手的地方，踩上了维修梯的第一阶。","id":141},{"type":"dialog","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"charslot","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":145},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_bg_76_g11_dtttowerfoot.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":149},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2","duration":"1","id":150},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"安洁！我接到嘉辛塔了！阿梅现在怎么样？","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#3$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"从塔底看不太清楚，我只知道刚刚她还在通讯塔的主电路板前面，照理来说只要更换通讯核心就搞定了。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"按照之前我们修塔的经验来看，应该很快就好了。有了通讯塔的导航，去南境的路也能安全一些。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"太好了，我们四个终于能一起上路了！","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"不过在此之前我们是不是应该考虑一下，该怎么从纵贯红土公司的职员和安保部队的包围中逃出去……","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$1","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"我只能用重力暂时拖缓他们的脚步，希望阿梅能快一点，我还从来没有持续使用过这么长时间的源石技艺，我担心……","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-22$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我们相信你安洁！你不是跟我们说过很多在罗德岛练习源石技艺的故事吗？","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#15$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"你不记得我们从大涌泉镇逃出来的那次了吗！我的源石技艺是会失控的啊——","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"呜……呜呜……","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#13$2","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"等一下，我怎么好像听到谁的哭声……","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#23$1","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1","id":175},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜&嘉辛塔","text":"是阿梅！","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"charslot","id":180},{"type":"background","id":181},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_76_i08.png","y":"-70","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.3","yScale":"1.3","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":184},{"type":"text","text":"阿梅利亚哭的时间总比别人久那么一点点。","id":185},{"type":"text","text":"四岁时她摔破膝盖，在河边哭了一个小时，当时她的父亲还在异国他乡打拼，她身边唯一的亲人——母亲，也在矿井工作，不能来扶她。","id":186},{"type":"text","text":"她哭累了之后拍拍身上的灰，一瘸一拐地走回家。","id":187},{"type":"text","text":"得知自己考上雷姆必拓工业大学之后，她在房间里哭了两个小时。","id":188},{"type":"text","text":"妈妈开心地要给她做当时很流行的胡萝卜千层派，但她不想让妈妈破费，两个人在厨房分享了一碗糖水炖胡萝卜。","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"妈妈离世的时候，她哭了一整天。","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"她曾下决心要给妈妈看看自己出人头地的样子，她想让一直操心的妈妈放心——除了父亲，自己也能成为她的依靠。","id":191},{"type":"text","text":"可惜她错过了机会。","id":192},{"type":"text","text":"她开始将所有努力的成果和证明寄回家，害怕再次失去令家人骄傲的机会。","id":193},{"type":"text","text":"她习惯性地加班、挨骂、再加班，研究她唯一擅长的东西，唯一能令她暂时忘却遗憾的东西。","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"只要坚持下去，她本应做得很出色啊……可为什么现在她站在失去工作、失去朋友、失去自信、失去梦想的边缘？","id":195},{"type":"text","text":"她手脚发软地往上爬，想挽回她所有做错的选择、做错的事，但她知道自己在发抖、在流泪。","id":196},{"type":"text","text":"她觉得自己永远爬不到顶端，永远会让别人失望，然后——","id":197},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.3","yScaleFrom":"1.3","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","duration":"0.3","yTo":"-50","id":198},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"阿梅利亚！","id":200},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"40","yTo":"0","id":201},{"type":"text","text":"一个熟悉的声音在她下面很远很远的地方嘶吼着。","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"嘉、嘉辛塔？","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"别回头啊笨蛋，你会掉下去的！动作不要停，有什么话直接说出来，我会在这里听着！","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"好、好……","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"嘉辛塔……真的对不起！你告诉我我其实很厉害的时候，我一开始其实——","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"其实不相信！","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"我看出来了！","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"公司里有太多前辈会说“你好厉害”！但其实那只是他们打招呼的一种方式！他们不会在意你做的任何东西！","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"你别扯着嗓子！就喊这些！扫兴的东西！我们明明还有别的要说！","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我——当你，还有塔妮、安洁莉娜！你们一遍一遍鼓励我的时候！我真的开始觉得我可以做到很多事！","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"所以我不小心把那些从来没有对任何人说过的想法和梦告诉了你们……但……呜……我现在还做不到这些……","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"大点声！我听不见！","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我没办法笃定地告诉你们我真的很想跟你们一起去南境！我也没办法果断地递出辞呈离开公司，我甚至连爬通讯塔都会害怕，呜——","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"不许哭，阿梅利亚！","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"然后你现在连哭也不让我哭！","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"……我是说！你睁开眼睛看看，你已经爬到！塔顶啦！","id":217},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"charslot","id":220},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":221},{"type":"image","id":222},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1b/Avg_bg_53_g16_sunnyday_L1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":225},{"type":"text","text":"阿梅利亚站在通讯塔尖，太阳好像在她触手可及的地方，整座大铁屯都在她的眼中。","id":226},{"type":"text","text":"她研发的通讯技术从这里延伸向北，连通了一个又一个小镇，一座又一座移动采矿平台。","id":227},{"type":"text","text":"让每个离家的人都有机会跟自己在意的人说几句话，让难以开口、却又想传达的心意不再有“距离”作为挡箭牌。","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"阿梅利亚突然发现，站在这里的时候，纵贯红土公司的标志变得很小很小，而自己在地面上的投影很大很大。","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我要辞职……","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"你说什么？","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我——说——","id":232},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":233},{"type":"multiline","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我！","id":234},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":235},{"type":"multiline","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"要！","id":236},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":237},{"type":"multiline","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"辞！","id":238},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":239},{"type":"multiline","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"职！","id":240},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我要辞职，我要去南境！","id":242},{"type":"dialog","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"charslot","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":246},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_bg_76_g11_dtttowerfoot.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":247},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":248},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":249},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"阿梅！通讯塔修好了没有啊！","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"感应器已经开始工作了，我修、修好啦——！","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"那你怎么一动不动的！","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我、我实在没有力气了，这里好高啊……","id":257},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":259},{"type":"charslot","id":260},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","id":261},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":262},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_329_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":264},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_329_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":266},{"type":"dialog","id":267},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"charslot","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#10$2","id":271},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"安保部队追上来了！快想想逃出去的方法，公司现在肯定不会放她走的！","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#14$2","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"唉，好不容易通讯塔修好了，我们还是没办法顺利去南境吗……","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$counterstrike_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_counterstrike_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":276,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#25$1","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"……","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-25$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我……呜呜……我现在该怎么办……","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"别哭啦，一会儿腿软了不小心站不住怎么办！","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#24$1","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"那不如……","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-24$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":285},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":286},{"type":"charslot","id":287},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":288},{"type":"background","id":289},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_76_i09_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":290},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.1","yScaleTo":"1.1","yTo":"-30","duration":"20","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":293},{"type":"text","text":"安洁莉娜握着法杖的手在发烫，她回想每一次练习源石技艺时的感受，没有一次与现在相同。","id":294},{"type":"text","text":"在训练室里，她花了无数个日夜控制源石技艺的施放方式，为自己制定了一套又一套训练方案，但她的源石技艺总是很不稳定。","id":295},{"type":"text","text":"从刚上罗德岛那次严重的发作中好转之后，华法琳医生非常严肃地找了她一次。","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"华法琳医生说，重力相关的源石技艺本来就极难操控，如果无法很好地控制，就尽量少使用它。","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"哪怕能够完全依靠施术单元，感染者也应该时常记得这一点：","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"没感染的人出错，消耗的是他人的信任，而感染者出错，燃烧的是自己的生命。","id":299},{"type":"dialog","id":300},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_76_i09_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","id":301},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","yTo":"0","duration":"0","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":303},{"type":"text","text":"华法琳的话，安洁莉娜其实听进去了。","id":304},{"type":"text","text":"但那句话，同样也在她心里种下了一颗小小的种子——有朝一日，她会成为那个会为一个人、一件事、一种理想，燃烧生命的人。","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"一种理想，现在距离她略显遥远。","id":306},{"type":"text","text":"但值得她拼尽全力的那件事，那些人，还有她自己，此刻就在眼前。","id":307},{"type":"text","text":"她已经错过了一次燃烧的机会，她不愿再错过一次。","id":308},{"type":"dialog","id":309},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d0/Avg_76_i09_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","xScale":"1.5","yScale":"1.5","id":310},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.05","yScaleTo":"1.05","duration":"1","id":311},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_OriginiumArts_wind_charge","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":313},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_OriginiumArts_wind_loop","loop":"true","channel":"l","volume":"0","id":314},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"l","fadetime":"2","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"……施术范围尽量做到最大，反重力程度尽量做到最高……","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"（小声）没问题。不会有问题的。","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"阿梅利亚！跳下来！","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔&塔妮","text":"什么？！","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"既然已经知道了我们每个人都想去南境，那就不应该停在这里！","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"跳下来，阿梅利亚，不要害怕！我会接住你，接住你们每个人！","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我不害怕，安洁……我相信你！！","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"好！","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"塔妮、嘉辛塔，你们也准备好了吗？","id":324},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔&塔妮","text":"嗯！","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"听我的口令！","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"三——","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"二——","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"一——","id":329},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_76_i09_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.3","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","id":331},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"35","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"跳——！","id":333},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"l","fadetime":"1","id":334},{"type":"dialog","id":335},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c9/Avg_76_i09_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.3","xScale":"1","yScale":"1","id":336},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_OriginiumArts_wind_burst","id":337},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"55","randomness":"50","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":338},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_boostblow","layer":"1","id":339},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.3","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":340},{"type":"charslot","id":341},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chimerawings","channel":"1","id":342},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind_howling","channel":"2","id":343},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_76_i10_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1","id":344},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","id":345},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":346},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_76_i10_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"3","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":348},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1.1","xScaleTo":"1.2","yScaleTo":"1.2","duration":"30","id":349},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_parachute_open","id":350},{"type":"text","text":"木箱中摆放整齐的胡萝卜、还在加紧向上层汇报的职员、四个心意相通的女孩，全都轻盈地飘到了空中。","id":351},{"type":"text","text":"阿什顿和安保人员感觉自己沉重的双脚失去束缚，又过于轻松地飘了起来，像是被人扔进水里的胡萝卜干。","id":352},{"type":"text","text":"塔妮失去重力后一时间失去了方向，在空中打转；嘉辛塔笑得开怀，充满好奇地看着这片失序的区域。","id":353},{"type":"dialog","id":354},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":355},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":356,"name":"act53side_01","style":"animekv","slot":"cgover","scalex":"1","scaley":"1","entryfrom":"0","entryto":"1","duration":"10","scalexto":"1","scaleyto":"1"},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_76_i10_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":357},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"5","block":"true","id":358},{"type":"text","text":"而安洁莉娜熟悉这种失重感。","id":359},{"type":"text","text":"正是这种感觉，带她从叙拉古到罗德岛，再从罗德岛去往千千万万的城市和地区。","id":360},{"type":"text","text":"她看着飘浮在身边的塔妮和嘉辛塔，看着在空中胡乱挥手的阿梅利亚，她从未像现在这样肯定，自己能成为她们最可靠的向导和朋友。","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"在这一方小小的飘浮天地，安洁莉娜第一次忘记了自己在成长的过程中失去了什么。","id":362},{"type":"text","text":"或许她错过了一些和父母相聚的时光，或许她错过了和重要的人说出心意的时机。","id":363},{"type":"text","text":"或许她曾对罗德岛的灾难、对红砂镇的感染者无能为力……","id":364},{"type":"text","text":"但此刻她手中沉甸甸的法杖在提醒她，她接住了自己的朋友，这个重量是她想要记住、想要保护的东西。","id":365},{"type":"text","text":"她们会四个人一起去南境。","id":366},{"type":"dialog","id":367},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"charslot","id":370},{"type":"image","id":371},{"type":"avgdisplay","id":372},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":373},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/61/Avg_bg_76_g15_dttsuburb_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":374},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":376},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$tech_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_sys_tech_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":377,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#22$1","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"呼……呼……好远。","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cf/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-22$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#5$2","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"因为来的时候塔下围着的都是纵贯红土公司的车嘛，我们就只能在这儿停车了。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"终于到车前面了，我们走吧！","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#14$2","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"天……天还在转……","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/18/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":386},{"type":"charslot","id":387},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_messagenotification","id":388},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"3","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":390},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_messagenotification","id":391},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"3","vibrato":"10","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":392},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":393},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"通讯果然恢复了……是谁的终端在响？","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#1$1","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我的。","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":398},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phonetype","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":400},{"type":"charslot","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#10$1","id":402},{"type":"multiline","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"是不是纵贯红土公司的人来找你麻烦！把终端给我，看我不骂那个阿什顿部长一顿——","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1","id":404},{"type":"multiline","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"欸？怎么真把终端给我了？","id":405},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"我已经回复完了。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#1$2","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我来看看，我来看看！","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"“辞呈在右手边最底下的抽屉里，锁已经提前打开了。”","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#16$2","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"“再也不见了，耽误我时间的垃圾们。”","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/79/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-16$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#16$1","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"哇……这是不是阿梅第一次骂人？","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"这就对了！以后多练习练习，还是骂轻了！","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#14$1","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"好啦，可以了吧！我也是有成长的……把终端还给我，我要把工作交流软件删了。","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":420},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_uninstallapp","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":422},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4236_tmslot_1#4$1","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"搞定！","id":424,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_4236_tmslot_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1","id":425},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"好，那我们就上路吧——","id":426,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":427},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"嘉辛塔。","id":428},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#3$1","id":429},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"妈妈？","id":430,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"是爸爸让你劝我回去的吗……","id":431,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b8/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"不，我是来送你的。","id":433},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#6$1","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"你们同意我去南境了？","id":435,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ab/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":436},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"你本来也不打算征得我们的同意，不是吗？","id":437},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#5$1","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"……","id":439,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"我们还是会担心你，嘉辛塔。你的身体情况，让你人生的容错比很多人都要低。","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"但我看见你的笑容了。","id":442},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#2$1","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"……欸？","id":444,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"你开车时的笑容，是自从你感染之后，我和你父亲就再也没在你脸上见到过的表情。","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"正如你的朋友塔妮小姐所说的那样……","id":447},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#2$2","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"欸？我？","id":449,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fd/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"我们虽然不认同你的决定，但我们终于明白了，你与我们分享你想做的事，是因为爱。","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"我已经想通了。至于你的父亲……那天他说了些违心的气话。我替他向你道歉。你从来都不是坎贝尔家的污点，嘉辛塔。","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"我觉得他是在后悔的，只是那个人在生意场上周旋了太久，甚至不愿意跟自己的女儿好好道个歉。","id":453},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#11$1","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"妈妈……","id":455,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1","id":456},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"不，没什么。如果等我从南境回来时他还没想通，你会站在我这边的，对吗？","id":457,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":458},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"当然。","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"上路吧孩子们。不用担心你们在纵贯红土公司闹出的那些小插曲，我们会想办法解决。","id":460},{"type":"dialogue","name":"优雅的夫人","text":"没有什么应该牵绊住我的孩子上路的步伐，哪怕是我跟你的父亲。","id":461},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4237_jcinta_1#1$1","id":462},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"谢谢你们……","id":463,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b3/Avg_avg_4237_jcinta_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4235_thumpy_1#15$2","id":464},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"（小声）真好啊……","id":465,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_4235_thumpy_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":466},{"type":"text","text":"塔妮忽然有种把终端从背包深处拿出来的冲动。","id":467},{"type":"text","text":"但那太麻烦了，她想。","id":468},{"type":"text","text":"现在最重要的是赶紧出发，前往南境，只要到了那里……","id":469},{"type":"charslot","id":470},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1015_aglna2_1#6$1","id":471},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"走，我们启程吧！","id":472,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_1015_aglna2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":473},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cardoorc","volume":"1","id":474},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":475},{"type":"charslot","id":476},{"type":"playsound","key":"$sportscarstart","volume":"1","id":477},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":478},{"type":"background","id":479},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_sand02","layer":"1","id":480},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sandstorm","loop":"true","channel":"f","volume":"0","id":481},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_76_i11.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.5","yScale":"1.5","x":"300","y":"130","id":482},{"type":"imagetween","xTo":"100","yTo":"60","duration":"60","block":"false","xScaleFrom":"1.5","yScaleFrom":"1.5","xScaleTo":"1.3","yScaleTo":"1.3","id":483},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":484},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":485},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":486},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"通往南境的关口已经打开，沙暴正在向我们行进的路段移动……","id":487},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"方向没有问题，进入沙暴范围内，我就不能为大家提供导航了，全得靠阿梅修好的通讯塔啦。","id":488},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"已经能看见沙暴的轮廓了。","id":489},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"说起来，塔妮，你的奶奶当年是怎么穿越沙暴抵达南境的，她告诉过你吗？","id":490},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"她当然说过啦。","id":491},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"奶奶说，她挑了一个源石浓度低，风沙也没那么大的日子穿越这片区域。","id":492},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"幸运的是，她穿越危险区的过程中，源石浓度一直没有太大变化，但快速移动型沙暴也让她吃了不少苦头。","id":493},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"她最后是靠着怀表增强了自己的法术，才没有被沙暴吞没，看见了南境的风景！","id":494},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"南境的风景是什么样的？","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"她说南境和大铁屯……和全雷姆必拓的风景都不一样！","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"那里的地面仿佛一面镜子，是大片大片的晶体！","id":497},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"晶体？","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"奶奶只说那里很漂亮，有清透的天空，有地面晶体上的积水，有缝隙中的小花，但我后来也找了很多资料……","id":499},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"据说那些晶体其实是和源石伴生的矿物。南境的源石早已经全部活性化，成了危险区源石粉尘的一部分。","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"而那些剩下的矿物非常坚硬，硬到连源石活性化的能量也不能破坏它们原有的结构……","id":501},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carjolt","volume":"1","id":502},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"25","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"——呜哇！刚才我们是撞到石头了吗？我的背包都差点飞出去了！","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"吓死我了，再检查一下安全带有没有系好！","id":505},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"既然这样，在进入颠簸路段之前……给！","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"胡萝卜披萨？","id":507},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"据说这东西现在是大铁屯的新特产，可……为什么？","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"“胡萝卜披萨，给亲朋送伴手礼的不二之选，仇人吃了都会重归于好。”","id":509},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"这可是店长冲我打包票的。","id":510},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"一起吃完披萨，之后谁都不准再提阿梅被公司欺负的事，连开玩笑都不可以！","id":511},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿梅利亚","text":"你们……呜……对不起……谢谢……","id":512},{"type":"dialogue","name":"嘉辛塔","text":"知道啦，吃完之后——不，就算没吃，我们也一直是最好的朋友啊。","id":513},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"……","id":514},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"安洁，你怎么不吃！","id":515},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"一定得吃胡萝卜披萨吗……","id":516},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"你不喜欢？店长说他手艺很正宗的，你一定能尝到家乡的味道！","id":517},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"我……我开车不方便！","id":518},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"我一会儿就得和大铁屯的塔台联络来规避危险了，没空吃东西的——","id":519},{"type":"dialogue","name":"塔妮","text":"我可以喂你吃呀？","id":520},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":521},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安洁莉娜","text":"呜啊啊——","id":522},{"type":"dialog","id":523},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":524},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":525},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":526},{"type":"bgeffect","id":527},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":528},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":529},{"type":"image","id":530},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":531}],"characters":["塔妮","嘉辛塔","阿梅利亚","安洁莉娜","？？？","安洁莉娜&嘉辛塔","嘉辛塔&塔妮","优雅的夫人"]}